{"name": "Duper", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Duper is a 5-player free-for-all game where strategy meets social trickery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"386\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/48bc80ea110086aa924521e8f5bf515b.poster.avif?t=1782724332\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/48bc80ea110086aa924521e8f5bf515b.webm?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/48bc80ea110086aa924521e8f5bf515b.mp4?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In an average 20-minute match, 5 players compete in real time to build power, make deals, and come out ahead. Each match is a contest of economics, diplomacy, and betrayal: gather resources, expand your position, negotiate trades, and decide when to cooperate and when to strike.\u00a0Players compete for precious Duper Gold (\ud83e\uddc8), the sole hard currency in the Duper ecosystem, by outsmarting each other in games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Elements and Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On a dying red star, every evolution begins with a surrender. And so, the story begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/fe00ddc674f58bd996db47a9cd020a3e.poster.avif?t=1782724332\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/fe00ddc674f58bd996db47a9cd020a3e.webm?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/fe00ddc674f58bd996db47a9cd020a3e.mp4?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Session starts after you match with 4 other players. In ranked mode, you can bid to compete for player colors with earlier turn order, such as Red.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"386\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/6a331c222dea319fabab582ee646c9ad.poster.avif?t=1782724332\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/6a331c222dea319fabab582ee646c9ad.webm?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/6a331c222dea319fabab582ee646c9ad.mp4?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build soldiers, tanks, planes, and forts to grow and defend your territory. Build research centers to boost your economy, unlock global trade, and acquire special unit types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"386\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/92a4f2573d40ee14517b765322e6b325.poster.avif?t=1782724332\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/92a4f2573d40ee14517b765322e6b325.webm?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/92a4f2573d40ee14517b765322e6b325.mp4?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control territory on a shared map by expanding, capturing tiles, and pressuring your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"386\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/48bc80ea110086aa924521e8f5bf515b.poster.avif?t=1782724332\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/48bc80ea110086aa924521e8f5bf515b.webm?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/48bc80ea110086aa924521e8f5bf515b.mp4?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press your advantage by using emblem cards and raising any time. Higher risk, higher reward. Not recommended for the lighthearted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"386\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/7e9f31bfe1cb70e8e5e2de271489ec57.poster.avif?t=1782724332\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/7e9f31bfe1cb70e8e5e2de271489ec57.webm?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/7e9f31bfe1cb70e8e5e2de271489ec57.mp4?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trade cards, blueprints, and keys every round, not just to get ahead on resource management, but also to develop important alliances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"386\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/cec8ad0fe4e8e3ac6071f6086bd33ee7.poster.avif?t=1782724332\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/cec8ad0fe4e8e3ac6071f6086bd33ee7.webm?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/cec8ad0fe4e8e3ac6071f6086bd33ee7.mp4?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transform your base to a superunit for unrivaled combat power, by sacrificing all your future coin yield. Only for a true gambler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"386\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/2b8b9121a9f8024c828f48097864cc0a.poster.avif?t=1782724332\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/2b8b9121a9f8024c828f48097864cc0a.webm?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/2b8b9121a9f8024c828f48097864cc0a.mp4?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in free-form diplomacy with chat, quick messages, and emojis. Whether it's genuine or just to make your next backstab more seamless, no one will ask.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"386\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/41f437929148143d71959c7efc25236f.poster.avif?t=1782724332\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/41f437929148143d71959c7efc25236f.webm?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/41f437929148143d71959c7efc25236f.mp4?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only 1 player ends each game. However, everyone who holds his keys gets a share of the prize pool. Win-win situation is entirely possible\u2014as long as someone loses big.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"386\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/8903c7cb14c824212e0eb22cb8b66313.poster.avif?t=1782724332\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/8903c7cb14c824212e0eb22cb8b66313.webm?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/8903c7cb14c824212e0eb22cb8b66313.mp4?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Outside the core game, acquire emblem cards, rare cosmetics, gold vouchers, and more in lootbox via Duper Gold, the sole hard currency in Duper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"386\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/ae26a9f18a0768dd30608442be6c10cd.poster.avif?t=1782724332\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/ae26a9f18a0768dd30608442be6c10cd.webm?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/extras/ae26a9f18a0768dd30608442be6c10cd.mp4?t=1782724332\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every game revolves around reading other players and adapting on the fly. Alliances can help you survive, but they are never permanent. A smart deal, a timely betrayal, or a well-planned attack can completely change the outcome of a match.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Duper is a 5-player real-time PvP social strategy game where players build their economy, trade resources, form alliances, and attack rivals. Every match blends negotiation, deception, and tactical decision-making as players compete to come out on top.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4542140/c1a189acc5226b6c347e2450aa164be343f99416/header.jpg?t=1782724332", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Social Deduction", "Diplomacy", "Resource Management", "Turn-Based Strategy", "Economy", "Strategy"], "developers": "Curiosity Research Inc.", "publishers": "Curiosity Research Inc.", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4542140", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "12 June 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/V17rsdnfkd0", "first_seen": 1781215200.0, "review_rank": 423}